    "updated_at": "2024-12-19T15:18:20Z",
    "body": "I think the note is accurate? As in, it seems fine to use it if the information is otherwise available or not that important, but you cannot rely on the end user having access to it. The most commonly used device to access the web does generally not expose `title` attributes on arbitrary elements, for instance.",
